---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import ArticleRow from '../components/ArticleRow.astro';
import TopicCards from '../components/TopicCards.astro';
import { getArticles } from '../lib/catalog';
import { learningPaths } from '../lib/learning-paths';
const articles = await getArticles();
const beginnerCount = learningPaths[0].stages.flatMap((stage) => stage.articleIds).length;
const featured = ['csharp-getting-started', 'csharp-value-reference-types', 'csharp-async-await']
  .map((id) => articles.find((article) => article.data.articleId === id)!);
---
<SiteLayout title="DevWiki">
  <section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <p class="eyebrow"><Icon name="spark" size={17} />從 C#，走到雲端上的電商系統</p>
    <h1 id="home-title">把知識串起來，<br /><span>讓系統可靠地運作。</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-description">用商品、訂單與通知理解 .NET、Redis、RabbitMQ，<br class="desktop-break" />再走進 Docker、Kubernetes、GKE 與維運。</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button-primary" href="/start/">開始閱讀<Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a><a class="text-link" href="/projects/ecommerce/">先看電商案例<Icon name="network" size={18} /></a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="path-banner" aria-labelledby="path-title">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">推薦學習路徑</p><h2 id="path-title">從第一個程式開始</h2><p>{beginnerCount} 篇核心文章，循序建立 C# 的完整輪廓。</p></div>
    <a class="button-primary" href="/learning-paths/csharp-beginner/">開始學習<Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a>
  </section>
  <section class="topic-section" aria-labelledby="entry-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="entry-title">選擇你的閱讀方式</h2><p>按領域深入、按案例串接，或查閱部署與維運。</p></div></div>
    <div class="knowledge-grid">
      <a class="knowledge-card" href="/knowledge-maps/dotnet-backend/"><Icon name="code" size={25} /><h3>深入學習 C#／.NET</h3><p>十個領域，從型別與非同步走到框架、資料、Runtime 和設計。</p><span class="text-link">閱讀 .NET 地圖<Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></span></a>
      <a class="knowledge-card" href="/projects/ecommerce/"><Icon name="box" size={25} /><h3>跟著電商案例學</h3><p>從商品、購物車到下單與通知，理解每項技術解決的問題。</p><span class="text-link">閱讀電商專題<Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></span></a>
      <a class="knowledge-card" href="/knowledge-maps/cloud-native/"><Icon name="layers" size={25} /><h3>部署與維運</h3><p>從容器、本機 K8s 到 GKE，串接權限、網路、交付、擴縮和恢復。</p><span class="text-link">閱讀雲端地圖<Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="topic-section" aria-labelledby="knowledge-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="knowledge-title">直接查閱一項技術</h2><p>{articles.length} 篇技術文章，也能各自理解背景、原理和限制。</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/topics/">所有主題<Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></a></div>
    <TopicCards />
    <p class="practice-path-link"><a class="text-link" href="/learning-paths/dotnet-backend-practice/">沿著 .NET 後端工作實務路徑閱讀<Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></a></p>
    <p class="practice-path-link"><a class="text-link" href="/practice/ecommerce/">準備實作環境與核對結果<Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></a></p>
  </section>
  <section class="featured-section" aria-labelledby="featured-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="featured-title">從這幾篇開始</h2><span class="eyebrow">編輯精選</span></div>
    <div class="article-list">{featured.map((article) => <ArticleRow article={article} />)}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="home-note"><Icon name="book" size={20} /><p>只讀網站就能理解概念。想跟做時，再由實作指南準備環境與操作。</p></section>
</SiteLayout>
